<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post6203532738612383044..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: The Global Land Grab</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>11</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1537606438402219924</id><published>2012-02-29T11:22:08.644-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-29T11:22:08.644-07:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;Gu Kul, who used to own and operate an autom...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;Gu Kul, who used to own and operate an automotive parts business in Chengdu, the capital of Sichuan province, has been victimized by China’s predatory corporate elite.&amp;#39;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Thank you for making my last point, the &amp;quot;elite&amp;quot; are capitalists, always ready to use the power of the state to protect their intrests and crush competition. What we have is an Orwellian change of meaning that now capitalism=private buisness enterprise......it was not that originally, starting with the Dissolution of Monasteries in England, where the land was taken by a few nobles and royals and their cronies. Then bankers to manipulate and make vast sums w/o any labor toward it. The chump change left after this goes to the laborer.....read John Medaille&amp;#39;s books..or something by Thomas Storck....</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/1537606438402219924'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/1537606438402219924'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html?showComment=1330539728644#c1537606438402219924' title=''/><author><name>Chris Campbell</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/18330217544238982513</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='23' height='32' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_JkQOSCu2L-I/SZRcZMMQ8cI/AAAAAAAAAAM/NzdxgWg0_m8/S220/n1456525546_3412.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6203532738612383044' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6203532738612383044' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1334419305"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 29, 2012 at 11:22 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1710853845663207597</id><published>2012-02-29T11:17:10.805-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-29T11:17:10.805-07:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;particularly when it’s understood that they ...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;particularly when it’s understood that they are not only capitalists but devout Catholics. &amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;actually, one really cannot be a Capitalist and a Catholic (definately, not a marxist either). Capitalism is another form of control by a few of most of productive property. Capitalists funded Marx and his later followers.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Think outside of the box-think Distributism.....</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/1710853845663207597'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/1710853845663207597'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html?showComment=1330539430805#c1710853845663207597' title=''/><author><name>Chris Campbell</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/18330217544238982513</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='23' height='32' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_JkQOSCu2L-I/SZRcZMMQ8cI/AAAAAAAAAAM/NzdxgWg0_m8/S220/n1456525546_3412.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6203532738612383044' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6203532738612383044' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1334419305"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 29, 2012 at 11:17 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3691068828557842482</id><published>2012-02-21T14:07:13.848-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-21T14:07:13.848-07:00</updated><title type='text'>To: Anonymous at Feb 15th 10:50AM&#xa;&#xa;Perhaps you sho...</title><content type='html'>To: Anonymous at Feb 15th 10:50AM&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Perhaps you should learn how to take care of yourself before tangling with the Vietnamese again. Loser.&lt;br /&gt;Oh, and: May lam mot ten cong san thoi tha.&lt;br /&gt;Lastly:&lt;br /&gt;Ron Paul 2012 or you are all fucked.&lt;br /&gt;Signed&lt;br /&gt;MR Zipperhead</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/3691068828557842482'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/3691068828557842482'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html?showComment=1329858433848#c3691068828557842482' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6203532738612383044' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6203532738612383044' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-306743223"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 21, 2012 at 2:07 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2508970658153331257</id><published>2012-02-20T07:52:46.108-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-20T07:52:46.108-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Anonymous, how is that different than the party sy...</title><content type='html'>Anonymous, how is that different than the party system in the US? If you do not grease the political wheels (donate to election coffers) your business, if you can get one started, will be quickly destroyed. Confiscation without remuneration happens in the US all the time unless you are from the moneyed class.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/2508970658153331257'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/2508970658153331257'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html?showComment=1329749566108#c2508970658153331257' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6203532738612383044' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6203532738612383044' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1663672075"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 20, 2012 at 7:52 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5829752276993878334</id><published>2012-02-20T05:02:44.453-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-20T05:02:44.453-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I know Vietnam quite a bit. The Communist Party is...</title><content type='html'>I know Vietnam quite a bit. The Communist Party is not a political party the way we know a political party - it is The Mafia. They are the &amp;#39;powers&amp;#39; in every aspect of the Vietnam society. You want to be in business and be successful at it, you have to be a member of the Party. Otherwise they crush you, confiscate whatever you have or they take your house, land, property, business.... all owned by the Party also called the State. &lt;br /&gt;And there is a limited number of members to be allowed. You have to be approved, to be part of the establishment.&lt;br /&gt;Wait a minute..... this sounds familiar....</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/5829752276993878334'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/5829752276993878334'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html?showComment=1329739364453#c5829752276993878334' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6203532738612383044' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6203532738612383044' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1362016146"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 20, 2012 at 5:02 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8378803403045138334</id><published>2012-02-19T13:44:18.787-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-19T13:44:18.787-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The Western World regarded property unlike others....</title><content type='html'>The Western World regarded property unlike others.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/8378803403045138334'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/8378803403045138334'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html?showComment=1329684258787#c8378803403045138334' title=''/><author><name>Mr. Mcgranor</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12851136550476241757</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-BYbvMXWKgFs/TWRwMaVUxNI/AAAAAAAAABk/-Djx96ZKJvc/s220/150_964816-0.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6203532738612383044' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6203532738612383044' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1659259730"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 19, 2012 at 1:44 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-486830073988852957</id><published>2012-02-15T23:18:31.662-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-15T23:18:31.662-07:00</updated><title type='text'>So I guess the trick is to not leave any evidence ...</title><content type='html'>So I guess the trick is to not leave any evidence of your defense.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/486830073988852957'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/486830073988852957'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html?showComment=1329373111662#c486830073988852957' title=''/><author><name>Isaac</name><uri>http://www.thestanfielddoctrine.blogspot.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6203532738612383044' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6203532738612383044' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-310009484"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 15, 2012 at 11:18 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6567260201755737089</id><published>2012-02-15T14:19:48.844-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-15T14:19:48.844-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I really think that Peter Doan Van Vuon and family...</title><content type='html'>I really think that Peter Doan Van Vuon and family deserve some sort of recognition for their act of defiance in defense of liberty (whether or not they would recognize it as such).  I&amp;#39;m sure that the same Amoricon flagwavers who mindlessly babble about America&amp;#39;s founding ideals (without having a clue as to what those actually are) would in the same breath denounce Mr. Vuon as an anarcho-terrorist, and without a hint of irony.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/6567260201755737089'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/6567260201755737089'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html?showComment=1329340788844#c6567260201755737089' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6203532738612383044' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6203532738612383044' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-529179912"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 15, 2012 at 2:19 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2313186043938351024</id><published>2012-02-15T10:55:05.937-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-15T10:55:05.937-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The land grab is just a further sign that Leviatha...</title><content type='html'>The land grab is just a further sign that Leviathan, The State, cares not a whit about the people it robs, in the form of the taxes it steals to fund itself, to further rape and pillage.  Only in America it seems they&amp;#39;re more anxious than ever to kill the geese that lay the every diminishing golden eggs.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/2313186043938351024'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/2313186043938351024'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html?showComment=1329328505937#c2313186043938351024' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6203532738612383044' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6203532738612383044' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 15, 2012 at 10:55 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7925647452275623603</id><published>2012-02-15T10:50:17.582-07:00</published><updated>2012-02-15T10:50:17.582-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Those zipperheads are making the big bad rough n&amp;#...</title><content type='html'>Those zipperheads are making the big bad rough n&amp;#39; tumble, rugged individual, unique just like everyone else in corporate gear, Americans look bad. Where do they get the heart to stand up like that. They should caress their chains and sing songs of praise to corporate pimps. Dissent is terrorism. The government needs to do something about these gooks so we can feel safe again. Can we invade now?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/7925647452275623603'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6203532738612383044/comments/default/7925647452275623603'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html?showComment=1329328217582#c7925647452275623603' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/02/global-land-grab.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6203532738612383044' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6203532738612383044' type='text/html'/><gd:ext